+- `audio/fpaudio.py`.
+
+The audio pipeline removes Markdown emphasis, flattens fenced material into spoken sentences, leaves bracketed text audible, and gives `---` a long pause. Paragraphs above its character threshold are sentence-split for rendering.
+
