+- Apparent repeated-word hits are grammatical `had had` and `that that`, not duplication errors.
+- The few lower-case paragraph openings and fragment-shaped entries are intentional document or italic continuations.
+
+### Numerals, measures and continuity
+
+- Nine Arabic-numeral tokens occur in body text. Every one is a visible mark or written designation: `Cu 3`, `110`, `36`, `95th`, `103rd`, `96th`, `110th`.
+- No English weekday, named month, or named season occurs. Generic season/month wording and permitted feet/yards/paces/cords usage are consistent with owner decisions.
+- Deployment progression is coherent: none → one → thirteen → fourteen → twenty-three → twenty-six → twenty-seven.
